  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt = int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    arr = list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    arr.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    pref = [0]*(3*n + 1)\r\n    for i in range(n*3):\r\n        pref[i+1] = pref[i] + arr[i]\r\n    ans = 0\r\n    for i in range(n+1):\r\n        y = n - i \r\n        l = 0\r\n        r = y\r\n        while l<r:\r\n            mid = l + (r-l)//2\r\n            e = 3*n-2*i-mid\r\n            res = (arr[i+2*mid]+arr[i+2*mid+1]-3*arr[e-1])\r\n            if res>=0:\r\n                l = mid+1 \r\n            else:\r\n                r = mid \r\n        mid = l \r\n        val = (2*pref[i]+pref[i+2*mid]+3*pref[3*n-2*i-mid])\r\n        ans = max(ans,val)\r\n    print(ans)",
